Ahel Desktop forked deepseek-harness at the upstream release
dsh-v0.2.1-alpha.1, marked in this repository by the tag that matches
upstream-base-*. Upstream published its packages under the @deepseek-ai npm
scope; this repository renamed every package to the @ahel scope, so the scope
alone does not tell inherited code from new code. Use these rules instead:

- A package directory that existed in deepseek-harness at the fork point holds
  inherited MIT code. Changes Ahel Technologies OÜ made to those files after
  the fork are Apache-2.0; `git log <upstream-base tag>..` lists them.
- A package directory that did not exist upstream is Ahel-authored. At the
  time of writing these are:

    packages/bundle/agent-tools                  @ahel/dsh-agent-tools
    packages/capture/window-capture              @ahel/dsh-window-capture
    packages/client/ui-ahel-account              @ahel/dsh-client-ui-ahel-account
    packages/client/ui-brand-ahel                @ahel/dsh-client-ui-brand-ahel
    packages/client/ui-command-palette           @ahel/dsh-client-ui-command-palette
    packages/client/ui-computer-use              @ahel/dsh-client-ui-computer-use
    packages/client/ui-hosted-chat               @ahel/dsh-client-ui-hosted-chat
    packages/client/ui-issues                    @ahel/dsh-client-ui-issues
    packages/client/ui-local-cli                 @ahel/dsh-client-ui-local-cli
    packages/client/ui-mcp-app                   @ahel/dsh-client-ui-mcp-app
    packages/client/ui-notifications             @ahel/dsh-client-ui-notifications
    packages/client/ui-window-capture            @ahel/dsh-client-ui-window-capture
    packages/computer-use/action-gate            @ahel/dsh-computer-use-action-gate
    packages/computer-use/cua-driver             @ahel/dsh-computer-use-cua-driver
    packages/credentials/ahel-account            @ahel/dsh-ahel-account
    packages/experimental/speech-to-text-ahel    @ahel/dsh-experimental-speech-to-text-ahel
    packages/llm/llm-ahel                        @ahel/dsh-llm-ahel
    packages/llm/llm-local-cli                   @ahel/dsh-llm-local-cli
    packages/web/web-search-ahel                 @ahel/dsh-web-search-ahel

  Third-party code bundled inside these packages keeps its own license, as
  listed under "Other third-party notices" below.

The `license` field in each workspace package.json reads "MIT", the value
inherited from deepseek-harness. It has not been changed per package; the
rules above and this NOTICE identify which terms apply.

